			"Message": "chore(Element): Synchronize 10 submodules for performance optimization and IPC efficiency\n\nPerform a coordinated update across the Land Editor ecosystem to eliminate dead code, optimize IPC handling, and streamline build configurations.\n\n**Cocoon**: Enable production tree shaking and conditionally disable debug logging, reducing the Main.js bundle by ~10% (1.49MB → 1.33MB). Refactor the performance monitoring service to a zero-overhead shim, replace array reductions with O(1) Exponential Moving Average for latency tracking, and update bootstrap watchdog polling to 5s with `unref` intervals.\n\n**Mountain**: Enable full diagnostic tracing and implement robust TTY detection to skip shell enhancements in interactive terminals. Introduce a high-frequency command filter in `WindServiceHandlers` to bypass OTLP spans and Echo submission for silent commands (e.g., `logger:*`, `storage`), significantly reducing CPU overhead during boot.\n\n**Wind**: Consolidate Layer composition using `Layer.mergeAll` to reduce intermediate objects from O(n) to O(1). Streamline Tauri IPC argument serialization and standardize production builds to strip console statements.\n\nUpdates to **Common**, **Echo**, **Output**, **Rest**, **SideCar**, **Sky**, and **Worker** align with build hygiene and architectural consistency. These changes enhance runtime efficiency and prepare the stack for intensive testing.",
			"SHA": "a934a1ae06b9ed97941b0e9dee2e9c1430e71ce2"
		},
